                                                "sense_id": "9190e94a-436a-3efb-ab68-f7658855bd65",
                                                "text": "These are all false and misleading statements taken from a handful of thousands of YouTube videos analyzed by the nonprofit Center for Countering Digital Hate (CCDH), which has identified a stark change in the tactics of climate deniers over the past few years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "884c7f59-9b03-46c8-bbeb-25cf8b969134",
